.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-FORK 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-fork \- Create, list, diff, drop or promote named forks of ROOT
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fork\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItx\fR> [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create, list, diff, drop or promote named forks of ROOT
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Name of the generated object
.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Valid\-time timestamp for the operation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItx\fR>

.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-fork\-list(1)
List named forks
.TP
quipu\-fork\-diff(1)
Diff two forks
.TP
quipu\-fork\-drop(1)
Drop a named fork
.TP
quipu\-fork\-promote(1)
Promote a fork to ROOT, with reviewable conflict decisions
.TP
quipu\-fork\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
